  "description": "ConfigVault.Client is a .NET configuration provider that seamlessly integrates with ASP.NET Core's configuration system to fetch and manage application settings from a centralized ConfigVault server. Features include automatic configuration refresh, secure API key authentication, encrypted value support, and compatibility with Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration. Ideal for microservices, distributed applications, and environments requiring centralized configuration management with real-time updates.",
